{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"やーい(¨)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おとといは選抜発表でした！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ライブ大好きな中田的には\n全国ツアーでアンダーなのはきついけど\n頑張ります！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/05/12/0287267/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日は\nとてもとてもテンションのあがったお仕事でした！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"また告知できるときにするけど\n本当に嬉しかったな～"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/05/12/0287267/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"人生観とか変わりそうな勢いです！` ･ω･ ´ふははは"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もう見てくださったかたもいらっしゃると思いますが\nのぎ天がアップされてます！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木團台湾ライブ密着\n前半戦でございます！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ゲリラライブしてきました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"密かに竿チームの楽器が変わってたりします"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/05/12/0287267/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"見てね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/05/12/0287267/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/05/12/0287267/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木團としての活動\n本当に嬉しいばかり。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"また何かやりたいな～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"たくさん練習しなきゃね！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/05/12/0287267/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"飯ぺろ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"話題にもなったポタジエ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"健康ブームな今にぴったりなお店です！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/05/12/0287267/0006.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"グリーンショート・トマト"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"見た目のインパクトすごいよね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/05/12/0287267/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でもね、味もちゃんとケーキになってるの！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ただ、野菜を使ってるってだけじゃなくて\n意外にマッチしててびっくり！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"トマトがフルーツなんじゃないかと錯覚しちゃうくらい\n美味しい"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/05/12/0287267/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"イートインだと\nテーブルがほとんど外にあるから\nこの季節ぴったり"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かな￣(=∵=)￣"}],"source":"archive"}